  "title": "Explanation of Huashang Fund Management Co., Ltd. Fund Product Risk Level Classification Rules",
  "content": "Explanation of Fund Product Risk Level Classification Rules\nAccording to the \"Administrative Measures for the Appropriateness of Securities and Futures Investors\" and the \"Guidelines for the Implementation of Appropriateness Management for Fund Raising Institutions (Trial)\" and other relevant regulations, Huashang Fund Management Co., Ltd. (hereinafter referred to as \"our company\"), based on comprehensive reference to factors such as product type, investment direction and scope, liquidity, maturity, structural complexity, and fundraising method, classifies product risk levels into five levels from low to high: R1, R2, R3, R4, R5.\nSpecific scoring indicators for fund product risk classification:\nBasic Product Information\nIs it a new fund\nIs it a publicly offered fund\nFundraising scale at establishment\nStarting point for subscription\nPerformance benchmark\nCustodian\nRisk reserve system\nCompany registered capital\nEvaluation Indicators\nFund type\nInvestment direction and scope\nFund openness\nMinimum investment amount\nCompany establishment time\nPersonnel stability (including company executives, fund managers, shareholders, investment research teams, etc.)\nSoundness of company governance structure and internal control system (Company ISAE3402)\nExistence of fund valuation policies, procedures, and pricing models\nCredit status of the fund manager, e.g., whether it has been subject to regulatory penalties in the past three years\nProduct structure complexity\nVolatility risk\nFund stock holding ratio (based on quarterly report stock investment)\nProduct liquidity (for existing products)\nBond maturity (for existing products)\nLeverage ratio (total assets to net assets)\nHistorical scale of the fund company\nPast performance and historical NAV volatility of the fund (ranking in the past three months, source: Galaxy Data. New funds are ranked based on the average of the company's similar funds)\nEvaluation Results\nR1: (Low risk level)\nR2: (Medium-low risk level)\nR3: (Medium risk level)\nR4: (Medium-high risk level)\nR5: (High risk level)\nNote: The above scoring standards apply to public fund products under our company that have been established for more than 3 months and have disclosed periodic reports. New funds will have their risk levels evaluated and publicized during the fundraising period according to the fund contract. If required by relevant laws and regulations or actual circumstances, our company may appropriately modify and improve the above evaluation methods. Our company dynamically tracks and evaluates the risk levels of its products.\nAppendix: Detailed Table of Risk Level Classification for Huashang Fund Products (Updated: July 31, 2025)\nFund Name\nRisk Level\n000279|Huashang Dividend Selection Flexible Allocation Mixed Securities Investment Fund\nR3\n000390|Huashang Advantage Industry Flexible Allocation Mixed Securities Investment Fund\nR3\n000541/024020|Huashang Innovation Growth Flexible Allocation Mixed Initiated Securities Investment Fund A/C\nR3\n000609/016048|Huashang New Quantitative Flexible Allocation Mixed Securities Investment Fund A/C\nR3\n000654|Huashang New Sharp Industry Flexible Allocation Mixed Securities Investment Fund\nR3\n000800|Huashang Future Theme Mixed Securities Investment Fund\nR3\n001106|Huashang Healthy Life Flexible Allocation Mixed Securities Investment Fund\nR3\n001143|Huashang Quantitative Enterprising Flexible Allocation Mixed Securities Investment Fund\nR3\n001448/002176|Huashang Double Wing Balanced Mixed Securities Investment Fund A/C\nR3\n001449|Huashang Double Drive Selection Flexible Allocation Mixed Securities Investment Fund\nR3\n001457/016070|Huashang New Normal Flexible Allocation Mixed Securities Investment Fund A/C\nR3\n001723/017927|Huashang New Power Mixed Securities Investment Fund A/C\nR3\n001751/001752|Huashang Credit Enhancement Bond Securities Investment Fund A/C\nR3\n001822/015385|Huashang Smart Life Flexible Allocation Mixe